This contains  TWO  versions of the Wall Door, V1.0 and V 1.1

1.1 is probably the one to use, however, there may be some problems with
1.1, so I've left 1.0 kicking around.

Don't ask me why, but if your system doesn't like 1.1, try 1.0 - I kept
it for SOME reason, wish I could remember what it was.

Craig Jackson gave us this door and completely KNOCKED us out.  It's an
online ANSI break-out door, and very very good.

